<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <style>
    body { font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #1a1a1a; max-width: 480px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 2rem 1rem; }
    h1 { font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    .btn { display: inline-block; padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem; background: #111; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 0.5rem; font-weight: 600; margin: 1rem 0; }
    .meta { font-size: 0.875rem; color: #666; margin-top: 2rem; padding-top: 1rem; border-top: 1px solid #eee; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>You've been invited to join <%= @site.name %></h1>
  <p>You've been invited as a <strong><%= @invitation.role %></strong> on <strong><%= @site.name %></strong> on Inkwell.</p>
  <p>Click the link below to accept this invitation:</p>
  <p><a href="<%= @accept_url %>" class="btn">Accept Invitation</a></p>
  <p class="meta">This invitation expires on <%= @invitation.expires_at.strftime("%B %d, %Y") %>. If you didn't expect this email, you can safely ignore it.</p>
</body>
</html>
